<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.10.8">
<l>tiruvuruvu kiṭanta vāṟuṅ koppūḻc centā maraimē ṟicaimukaṉ</l>
<l>karuvuḷvīṟ ṟiruntu paṭaittiṭṭa karumaṅkaḷum</l>
<l>poruvi luṉṟaṉi nāyakamavai kēṭkun tōṟumeṉ ṉeñca niṉṟu nek</l>
<l>karuvi cōruṅ kaṇṇī reṉceykē ṉaṭiyēṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Whenever I hear those about your unmatched solitary leadership,</l>
<l>[your] deeds [as] when you created, sitting in distinction in a womb,</l>
<l>the one with faces in [all] directions on a red lotus in [your] navel, and the way [your] sacred form lies,</l>
<l>my hearts dissolves [and] tears fall [like] a waterfall. What can I, [your] servant do?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
